    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9465" root="حور" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَجُلٌ حَائِرٌ بَائِرٌ</span></b>  <i>A man in a defective and bad
state</i>: (S, TA:) or <i>perishing,</i> or <i>dying.</i> (S.)
[See the same phrase in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حير</span>: see also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَوْرٌ</span>:
and see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَائِرٌ</span>, in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بور</span>; where it is said that <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بائر</span>
is here an imitative sequent of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حائر</span>.] ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحَارَةٌ</span>.

